    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Savor the flavor... it\u2019s to die for!&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Cybercook, Where the customer is... always on the menu. In this retro cyberpunk world, you\u2019re the chef at a twisted restaurant serving the ultimate delicacy: <strong>human meat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366140/extras/636531de39c7b2ed0ae76b1f9956fbfc.poster.avif?t=1740768419\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366140/extras/636531de39c7b2ed0ae76b1f9956fbfc.webm?t=1740768419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use your precision slicing skills to carve up your customers, each with their own shady backstory. Over 10 days, you\u2019ll learn just how dark their lives really are and decide whether to end it with a slice or make them kill themselves.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366140/extras/401d82989f123ccd27eddea6bd6c2730.avif?t=1740768419\" width=616 height=100 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision Slicing Mechanic:</strong> Your blade, your rules. Every cut is exact, and every slice a new regret.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Choices, Their Problem</strong>: Kill, manipulate, or steal memories. Your choices shape their fates... and your nightmares.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unfolding NPC Stories</strong>: Five twisted characters, each with secrets to spill (or guts?).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366140/extras/56ca2303176b1b9ad2b988685378f48c.poster.avif?t=1740768419\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366140/extras/56ca2303176b1b9ad2b988685378f48c.webm?t=1740768419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysterious Puppet Master</strong>: Follow (or defy) the ominous voice steering you toward a truth sharper than your knife. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slice for Fun (Because Why Not?)</strong>: Need a break from ethical dilemmas? Bonus levels let you indulge in pure slicing mayhem, no strings attached. It\u2019s chaos, it\u2019s cathartic, and yes, it\u2019s technically \u201ccooking.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366140/extras/1cde1517940a23666920f1568a0a0aba.poster.avif?t=1740768419\" width=600 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366140/extras/1cde1517940a23666920f1568a0a0aba.webm?t=1740768419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366140/extras/1cde1517940a23666920f1568a0a0aba.mp4?t=1740768419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Cybercook, where the only thing on the menu is regret. (And maybe a side of salad.)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
