nymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366140/extras/56ca2303176b1b9ad2b988685378f48c.poster.avif?t=1740768419\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366140/extras/56ca2303176b1b9ad2b988685378f48c.webm?t=1740768419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysterious Puppet Master</strong>: Follow (or defy) the ominous voice steering you toward a truth sharper than your knife. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slice for Fun (Because Why Not?)</strong>: Need a break from ethical dilemmas? Bonus levels let you indulge in pure slicing mayhem, no strings attached. It\u2019s chaos, it\u2019s cathartic, and yes, it\u2019s technically \u201ccooking.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366140/extras/1cde1517940a23666920f1568a0a0aba.poster.avif?t=1740768419\" width=600 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366140/extras/1cde1517940a23666920f1568a0a0aba.webm?t=1740768419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366140/extras/1cde1517940a23666920f1568a0a0aba.mp4?t=1740768419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Cybercook, where the only thing on the menu is regret. (And maybe a side of salad.)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
